  "sourceLocator": {
    "chapter": "Classes",
    "section": "3.257",
    "heading": "Level I: Innate Sorcery",
    "lineStart": 3976,
    "lineEnd": 3983
  },
  "section": "3.257",
  "rulesText": "An event in your past left an indelible mark on you, infusing you with simmering magic. As a Bonus Action, you can unleash that magic for 1 minute, during which you gain the following benefits:\n\n- The spell save DC of your Sorcerer spells increases by 1.  \n- You have Advantage on the attack rolls of Sorcerer spells you cast.\n\nYou can use this feature twice, and you regain all expended uses of it when you finish a Long Rest."
}
